{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10131050","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10131050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1013105001:0":{"text":"앞쪽에 영지가 있어요... 바위틈 사이로 골렘들이 어슬렁거리는 게 보이네요.","source_cn":"前方那片营地——虽有山石掩映，仍能看到魔偶在周围徘徊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9504D4BBC0A25EB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1013105002:0":{"text":"영지에 누가 있는 것 같은데, 골렘들이 습격하지 않고 있어요! 이건 정말 이상한데요?","source_cn":"那片营地里好像有人！魔偶却不进去袭击，真是奇怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC68EF66D90D83E2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013105003:0":{"text":"그러게. 골렘이 인간과 사이좋게 지낼 리가 없는데...","source_cn":"确实，魔偶可没那么容易和人和谐共处……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3DDF78C5441EB8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}